OL,3,GNEWSAMen deny charges over small boat
OL,4,Alanding in Essex
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men, charged over a small boat
OL,7,Flanding on the Essex coastline, have
OL,8,Fpleaded not guilty during a court
OL,9,Fappearance.
OL,11,FKonrad Dabrowski and Damien Ciuron, who
OL,12,Fare both from Bradford, and Illia
OL,13,FPrendi, of no fixed abode, entered the
OL,14,Fpleas during a hearing at Chelmsford
OL,15,FCrown Court on Thursday.
OL,17,FThe boat was spotted on the beach at
OL,18,FHolland-on-Sea, near Clacton-on-Sea, on
OL,19,F1 July and the men have been accused of
OL,20,Ffacilitating illegal immigration.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
