OL,3,GNEWSAMen deny charges over small boat
OL,4,Alanding in Essex
OL,5,
OL,6,FChristian Albano, who was the boat's
OL,7,Fpilot and was arrested at sea by Border
OL,8,FSecurity Command, also appeared in
OL,9,Fcourt. He entered a guilty plea and has
OL,10,Fbeen remanded in custody until his
OL,11,Fsentencing.
